 "description": "The document nar-compare.compare() emits: per-side inventories (old/new), the diff block, and the extended analysis block. Rewritten in the 2.6.2 stability campaign (E-03): the previous schema described a pre-2.0 document (old_sha256/new_sha256/categories) that no produced comparison has matched for several releases, and no test validated a real comparison.json against it.",
